generate.prompt:
From this premise:
{premise}

Invent a small cast (2-5) of characters and a set of scenes/locations that frame a coherent interactive story a player can step through, talking to characters and making choices.

Emit ONE path-bearing fence at story.json containing exactly this JSON shape, nothing else in the fence:
{{
  "premise": "...",
  "characters": [
    {{"name": "...", "voice": "one line describing how they speak/act", "motivation": "what they want"}}
  ],
  "scenes": [
    {{"id": "...", "location": "...", "description": "what this place is and what's happening here at the start"}}
  ]
}}

The JSON must be syntactically valid. No commentary outside the fence.
